          "message": {
            "text": "HWPX template export reflects archive and filesystem errors\n\nThe public HWPX route returns raw archive or filesystem Error.message.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Information exposure error handling\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-209\n\nRemediation:\nReturn a fixed public error and log details server-side.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for hwpx-error-detail.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:9beafc6160f550a05584b2f7bec25218e81976f6ab6549be4651236d05e3f3c1"
