                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Workspace provisioning can create duplicate organizations and sites\n\nConcurrent first-use calls can duplicate organizations and same-name sites through select-then-insert.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Race condition tenant provisioning\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-362\n\nRemediation:\nAdd idempotency keys, uniqueness, and transactional provisioning.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for workspace-provisioning-race.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:644d0bbee0a8366456cc7b5e86eeaebb3d3011350539a82de81d0090c2ae4e2b"
          },
          "properties": {
