                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Query logs table is exposed without row-level security\n\nMigration 001 creates query_logs without RLS, exposing stored query text under normal grants if deployed.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Missing authorization RLS\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nEnable RLS and make writes service-role-only.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for query-logs-no-rls.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:c8fd851e904e4c62c12a70cc6fcbb8f210d2055567f110537f74197c43e5a3f7"
          },
