          "message": {
            "text": "Safety-reference status work survives client disconnect\n\nStatus work holds scarce concurrency while catalog, corpus, and registry work continues without request cancellation.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion cancellation\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nPropagate request.signal and release the lease on disconnect.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for status-disconnect.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
