          "message": {
            "text": "NULL dispatch-log tenants bypass row-level authorization\n\ndispatch_logs is nullable and its RLS accepts NULL, so authenticated roles can manage unscoped receipts.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Authorization bypass audit integrity\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nMake organization_id non-null and remove NULL wildcard policies.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Reject the negative path for null-dispatch-tenant.\n- Preserve the intended bounded path.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce the invariant in a shared database or admission control.\n- Add a negative regression test for the direct path."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:f009021f878c7e27193c278f8d1f519576683411c692bd6bd1da87ea5be24dd7"
          },
